.cm MANY XEDIT macro
 
 
|MANY XEDIT macro%
 
 
.cs 1 off
.cs 2 on
 
|Purpose:%
  Create some user and prefix commands to make your editing easier.
 
|How to implement MANY:%
 
  To use the MANY XEDIT macro you need to set prefix synonyms in
  your XEDIT PROFILE.
  Using the SET PREFIX command SET PREFIX SYNONYM <synonym> MANY.
  Also you need some commandline synonyms. Use SET SYNONYM <synonym> MANY.
 
  If you are getting to many commands you can use CMS PIPE and a list
  to do you settings.
 
  You need to create a file MANY <userid> to contain settings about:
  name, initials, location and phone nr. Also it sets the length
  of the comments that are created by MANY XEDIT.
  See: MANY SAMPLE as a template
 
 
  Note: not all items are mentioned below see MANY XEDIT for actual
  synonyms and details.
.cs 2 off
.cs 4 on
 
|        Name         Prefix  Cmdline     Subroutine & Switch              Description%
 
  |A%    ANC          Prefix              HTML_Anchor                     /* Insert HTML anchor                        */
 
  |B%    B            Prefix              BOT                             /* Go to BOTTOM of file                      */
         BOX          Prefix              Make_Box                        /* Create comment BOX                        */
 
  |C%    CEN          Prefix              Adjust_Layout center            /* Center the text                           */
         CKLDD        Prefix              Check_Loaded                    /* Insert code to test EXECLOADed stuff      */
         COM          Prefix              Make_Com                        /* Comment part of code                      */
         CONS         Prefix              Make_Cons                       /* Add cons                                  */
 
  |D%    DCM          Prefix              Make_Dcm                        /* De-comment part of code                   */
         DO           Prefix              Make_Do                         /* Create DO skeleton                        */
 
  |F%    FIL          Prefix              FILE                            /* File the File                             */
         FMTP         Prefix              Make_FMTP                       /* Format a PIPE                             */
 
  |H%    HD           Prefix              Make_Heading                    /* Create my default heading                 */
         HH           Prefix              HTML_Hdr times                  /* Create H1-5                               */
         HTML         Prefix              HTML                            /* Add HTML top                              */
 
  |I%    IF           Prefix              Make_If                         /* Create IF skeleton                        */
         IMG          Prefix              HTML_Image                      /* Create Image entry                        */
 
  |L%    LEF          Prefix              Adjust_Layout left              /* Left adjust the text                      */
         LOW          Prefix              Switch_Case lower               /* Lowercase record                          */
 
  |M%    MC           Prefix              Add_Changelog                   /* Add changelog to heading                  */
 
  |N%    N            Prefix              Make_Date                       /* Insert date                               */
         NODE         Prefix  Cmdline     Make_Node                       /* Insert code to get NODE                   */
         NUL          Prefix              Switch_Nulls                    /* Flip the NULLS setting                    */
 
  |O%    OL           Prefix              HTML_List ol                    /* Create Ordered list                       */
 
  |P%    PBOX         Prefix              Make_Pbox                       /* Add a comment box                         */
         PCM          Prefix              Make_Pipe_Comm                  /* Comment a PIPE                            */
         PIF          Prefix              Make_Pipe_If                    /* Add a IF                                  */
         PIPE         Prefix              Make_Pipe                       /* Create PIPE stmt                          */
         PIPNM        Prefix  Cmdline     Make_Pipe_Names                 /* Give all PIPEs a NAME                     */
         PN           Prefix              Make_PN                         /* Add a name                                */
 
  |R%    RIG          Prefix              Adjust_Layout right             /* Right adjust the texts                    */
         RXEXT        Prefix  Cmdline     Make_Exit_Code                  /* Universal EXIT routine                    */
         RXHLP        Prefix  Cmdline     Make_Help_Code                  /* Insert help section in code               */
         RXTS         Prefix  Cmdline     Make_TimeStamp_Code             /* Create a timestamp                        */
 
  |S%    SAV          Prefix              SAVE                            /* Issue SAVE on the file                    */
         SEL          Prefix              Make_Select                     /* Create SELECT skeleton                    */
         START        Prefix  Cmdline     Make_Start                      /* Simple rexx start                         */
         SUB          Prefix              Make_SubRoutine                 /* Insert SUBroutine sample                  */
 
  |T%    T            Prefix              TOP                             /* Go to TOP of file                         */
         TAG          Prefix              Make_Tag                        /* Create tag                                */
         TBL          Prefix              HTML_Table times                /* Create a Table                            */
         TR           Prefix              Make_Trace                      /* Switch TRACE                              */
         TS           Prefix              Make_TimeStamp                  /* Create timestamp                          */
 
  |U%    UL           Prefix              HTML_List ul                    /* Create UN-Ordered list                    */
         UPP          Prefix              Switch_Case upper               /* Uppercase record                          */
 
  |V%    VSPEC        Prefix              VSpec                           /* Verticalise SPEC                          */
 
  |Z%    Z            Prefix              Go_To_End                       /* Go to end of line                         */
.cs 4 off 
  
  
